{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/docs/layout,_N_T_/docs/page,_N_T_/docs"},"routeCache":{"key":"/route-cache/APP_PAGE/3a9449929431fb37375ceea13fffd0c0983db62908761ead5ae8181351b41183/$/docs","owner":{"kind":"APP_PAGE","sourceRoute":"/docs/page"},"isFallback":false}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><!--jzwGESMIhiSJC86oeaj7x--><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/59c53da59c4783e3.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-74c939c87fa0092a.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/4bd1b696-c023c6e3521b1417.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/255-b1e2483a7e02feee.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/main-app-7f6081441c67b1a1.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/619-ba102abea3e3d0e4.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/docs/page-fd4885a4f6cfd1b6.js\" async=\"\"></script><title>Kers Secure — Protect &amp; Monetize your scripts</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Private Lua/Luau hosting, licensing and access control.\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><!--$--><main><nav class=\"top\"><a class=\"brand\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"brand-mark\">K</span>KERS<span>SECURE</span></a><div class=\"toplinks\"><a href=\"/dashboard\">Dashboard</a><a class=\"btn primary\" href=\"/api/auth/discord\">Sign in with Discord</a></div></nav><section class=\"hero\" style=\"padding-top:75px;text-align:left\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">HELP CENTER · KERSSECURE</div><h1 style=\"font-size:clamp(38px,6vw,58px);letter-spacing:-2.5px;margin:16px 0\">Documentation<span class=\"gradient-text\">.</span></h1><p style=\"margin:0\">Everything you need to get started and manage your script workspace.</p><div style=\"display:grid;gap:13px;max-width:850px;margin-top:38px\"><article class=\"card\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:42px 1fr;gap:12px\"><div class=\"feature-icon\" style=\"margin:0\">01</div><div><h2 style=\"font-size:15px;margin:2px 0 8px\">Getting started</h2><p class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;margin:0\">Sign in using your Discord account, create a project, then upload a Lua or Luau script to begin managing releases.</p></div></article><article class=\"card\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:42px 1fr;gap:12px\"><div class=\"feature-icon\" style=\"margin:0\">02</div><div><h2 style=\"font-size:15px;margin:2px 0 8px\">Discord authentication</h2><p class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;margin:0\">KersSecure uses Discord OAuth2 for account sign-in. No API-key login or separate password is required. The OAuth callback must match the deployed application URL.</p></div></article><article class=\"card\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:42px 1fr;gap:12px\"><div class=\"feature-icon\" style=\"margin:0\">03</div><div><h2 style=\"font-size:15px;margin:2px 0 8px\">Projects and scripts</h2><p class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;margin:0\">Projects organize hosted scripts and licenses. Upload supported Lua, Luau or text files through the project workspace. Keep source storage private.</p></div></article><article class=\"card\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:42px 1fr;gap:12px\"><div class=\"feature-icon\" style=\"margin:0\">04</div><div><h2 style=\"font-size:15px;margin:2px 0 8px\">License management</h2><p class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;margin:0\">Create license keys from a project, then activate, suspend or revoke them. Newly generated license keys are only shown once, so store them securely.</p></div></article><article class=\"card\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:42px 1fr;gap:12px\"><div class=\"feature-icon\" style=\"margin:0\">05</div><div><h2 style=\"font-size:15px;margin:2px 0 8px\">Cloudflare deployment</h2><p class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;margin:0\">The application is built for Cloudflare Workers using the OpenNext adapter. Configure runtime bindings and secrets in the Cloudflare Worker settings, and deploy through the repository workflow.</p></div></article><article class=\"card\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:42px 1fr;gap:12px\"><div class=\"feature-icon\" style=\"margin:0\">06</div><div><h2 style=\"font-size:15px;margin:2px 0 8px\">Security</h2><p class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;margin:0\">Keep SESSION_SECRET, LICENSE_HASH_SECRET, Discord credentials, database credentials and R2 access keys private. Never commit them or expose them to browser-side code.</p></div></article></div><p class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:11px;margin-top:30px\">KersSecure · Documentation</p></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-74c939c87fa0092a.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[9766,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n3:I[8924,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n4:I[2619,[\\\"619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/619-ba102abea3e3d0e4.js\\\",\\\"40\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/docs/page-fd4885a4f6cfd1b6.js\\\"],\\\"\\\"]\\nc:I[7150,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/css/59c53da59c4783e3.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"0:{\\\"P\\\":null,\\\"b\\\":\\\"jzwGESMIhiSJC86oeaj7x\\\",\\\"p\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"c\\\":[\\\"\\\",\\\"docs\\\"],\\\"i\\\":false,\\\"f\\\":[[[\\\"\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"docs\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"__PAGE__\\\",{}]}]},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",true],[\\\"\\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$1\\\",\\\"c\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"style